  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00001",
      "text": "Following a yellow level Adverse Weather Alert from the country's Meterological Office, Trinidad and Tobago was put under a national emergency weather warning on November 26. In the context of “further incoming heavy rainfall over the next two days,” the Office of the Prime Minister posted the announcement on its Facebook page, citing “excessively heavy rains” and water courses “at or […] close to capacity”:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 411,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/OPMTT/posts/pfbid0i6ZpPkcxyjBbiENzSkzG6v68VM2mbYGSAU2VmCPAeCDjSxrEvbm8A78gbrLt4bwHl",
        "https://www.metoffice.gov.tt/early_warning"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00002",
      "text": "> Already there is significant damage to our road infrastructure in very many parts of the country. We are anticipating increased flooding and landslides in susceptible areas.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 413,
      "body_end": 588,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00003",
      "text": "Prime Minister Keith Rowley encouraged citizens to stay indoors if possible, and reassured the public that the relevant state agencies were mobilised to assist in what he termed “very threatening circumstances.”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 590,
      "body_end": 801,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00004",
      "text": "The wet season, which typically runs from June to December, has been a particularly active one this year. By mid-morning on November 26, several rivers across the country were at dangerously high levels:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 803,
      "body_end": 1006,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/2022/10/06/trinidad-tobago-suffers-the-effects-of-yet-another-tropical-weather-system/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00005",
      "text": "Images and videos of widespread flooding, as well as warnings about potentially dangerous areas, were soon being shared on social media channels like WhatsApp, Facebook and Twitter:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 1008,
      "body_end": 1189,
      "source_links": [
        "https://twitter.com/TTWeatherCenter/status/1596488030960979968",
        "https://www.facebook.com/permalink.php?story_fbid=pfbid02geN6nGpZmweHjLuzLT9bWmWyRkVfQCp1kNKF6Er3EdCFkVkYgE84Wp5957Sxb5Qsl&id=100068614458433"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00006",
      "text": "Just the day before, the Manzanilla Stretch, which runs parallel to the Atlantic Ocean on the eastern coast of Trinidad, was blocked off to vehicular traffic following flooding that caused parts of the road to cave in. Video of the scene was shared widely on WhatsApp:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 1191,
      "body_end": 1459,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00007",
      "text": "On Twitter, @TTWeatherCenter reported:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "body_start": 1461,
      "body_end": 1499,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00008",
      "text": "Low-lying Central Trinidad seemed particularly hard hit:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "body_start": 1501,
      "body_end": 1557,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00009",
      "text": "In addition to flooding, other areas were experiencing landslips and felled trees:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "body_start": 1559,
      "body_end": 1641,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=509642737767273"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00010",
      "text": "Just after midday, the Meterological Office had added a yellow-level Riverine Flood Alert to its existing yellow-level weather alert; by early afternoon, it was being reported that key routes were under water:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "body_start": 1643,
      "body_end": 1852,
      "source_links": [
        "https://twitter.com/TTMetOffice/status/1596540240524713997"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00011",
      "text": "Many roadways across the country had already been rendered impassable earlier in the day.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "body_start": 1854,
      "body_end": 1943,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=1881311785568561",
        "https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=514182173974543",
        "https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=575371894593599",
        "https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=818235155931179"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00012",
      "text": "Shortly before 3:00 p.m. local time (UTC-4), the Met Office explained:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "body_start": 1945,
      "body_end": 2015,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/TTMetService/posts/pfbid0TRvqjAzPucSqZEyCd6rBW1AQ4sM4jDZhk7VWboi7DpuPnkJv9xB44Da2xWTCTLzzl"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00013",
      "text": "> A low-level trough is passing Trinidad and Tobago […] and, at this time, we continue to have the low-level moisture convergence associated with it. There is also some support in the mid to upper levels of the atmosphere for the development of deep convective activity, which can produce heavy showers and thunderstorms over some areas.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 13,
      "body_start": 2017,
      "body_end": 2354,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00014",
      "text": "It also noted that any run-off would be slow, given that high tide is estimated to happen at approximately 5:30 p.m. on November 26, 2022, and again at 6:55 a.m. and 6:24 p.m. on November 27.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 14,
      "body_start": 2356,
      "body_end": 2547,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00015",
      "text": "Aerial footage of some of the flooding gave some idea of its scope. One video of the St. Joseph river overtopping showed a lot of garbage — much of it discarded plastic bottles — trapped against a bridge as the water rushed on. Littering is a phenomenon that is a major contributor to the country's flooding problems. The fact that so much of the trash consists of single-use plastics also raises concerns about public awareness of the climate crisis, especially since Trinidad and Tobago is a signatory to several Multilateral Environmental Agreements (MEAs) on climate change.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 15,
      "body_start": 2549,
      "body_end": 3127,
      "source_links": [
        "https://planning.gov.tt/content/climate-change-and-meas-where-does-tt-stand",
        "https://www.facebook.com/TTWeatherCenter/",
        "https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=1131759601043069"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-776217-b00016",
      "text": "The Adverse Weather Alert will stay in effect until 8:00 p.m. on November 26, even though rain is expected to continue for a few days.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "body_start": 3129,
      "body_end": 3263,
      "source_links": [
        "https://newsday.co.tt/2022/11/26/adverse-weather-alert-in-effect-until-8-pm/#.Y4I19SqBHyg.facebook",
        "https://www.metoffice.gov.tt/early_warning"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    }
  ],
